h Space Infrastructure Stock Is a Better Buy for 2027?","src":"The Motley Fool","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-23","zh":"Intuitive Machines 與 Redwire：2027 年哪種太空基礎設施股票比較值得買？"},{"title":"Intuitive Machines Advances Space Nuclear Systems to Enable Lunar Night Survival","src":"GlobeNewswire","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-23","zh":"直覺式機器推進太空核系統，實現月球夜間生存"}],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1844452/000162828026019865/lunr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Intuitive Machines, Inc., collectively with its subsidiaries (the \"Company,\" \"IM,\" \"Intuitive Machines,\" \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our\") is a space infrastructure and services company founded in 2013 and focused on enabling sustained infrastructure and human activity beyond Earth. We believe the United States is transitioning from episodic space missions to long-duration operations and persistent presence, and we are building the systems and services required to support this evolution across civil, national security, and commercial markets.","zh":null},{"en":"We build spacecraft, connect space-based networks, and operate infrastructure as-a-service that support operations across low Earth orbit (\"LEO\"), geostationary orbit (\"GEO\"), cislunar space, and deep-space. Our strategy is to evolve space activity from single-mission execution toward continuously operating infrastructure by combining spacecraft delivery with network connectivity and long-term operations. We believe this approach positions us to support enduring government requirements while enabling the development of a commercial space economy.","zh":null},{"en":"On September 16, 2022, Inflection Point Acquisition Corp. (\"IPAX\") entered into a business combination agreement with Intuitive Machines, LLC. On February 10, 2023, IPAX domesticated into a Delaware corporation and changed its name to \"Intuitive Machines, Inc.\" in connection with the domestication, Intuitive Machines, Inc. became a holding company whose principal assets are the Intuitive Machines, LLC Common Units.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We are an integral partner to our customers and partners. We execute on our commitments and develop end-to-end mission solutions for our commercial, civil and national security customers.","zh":null},{"en":"NASA. We are partnered with and service NASA by building power and propulsion spacecraft, connected data services, operating mobility infrastructure, lunar cargo delivery and other Artemis-related contracts. In 2019, NASA awarded us a contract to develop and construct the power and propulsion element for the agency's lunar Gateway (the contract was awarded to Lanteris prior to the consummation of the Lanteris acquisition (as further discussed herein)). Through strategic acquisition, Intuitive Machines is providing advanced deep-space navigation services for multiple NASA Artemis-related missions. We are one of two awardees for NASA's Near Space Network Direct-to-Earth data services to the lunar vicinity (1.2) and beyond the lunar vicinity (1.3). We are also the sole awardee for the Near Space Network's data relay services (2.2), which will provide a constellation of satellites around the","zh":null}],"competition":[],"segments":{},"peers":["RDW","PL","ASTS","RKLB","FLY"]}}